sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Customer Browser
  participant FE as Next.js Frontend/BFF
  participant GW as Nginx Gateway
  participant Pay as payment-service
  participant SePay as SePay
  participant Redis as Redis Streams/PubSub
  participant Order as order-service
  participant Product as product-service
  participant Email as email-service

  U->>FE: Submit checkout BANK_TRANSFER
  FE->>GW: POST /api/payments/checkout-intent
  GW->>Pay: POST /payments/checkout-intent
  Pay->>SePay: Create QR / virtual account order
  SePay-->>Pay: QR, VA number, expiry
  Pay-->>FE: paymentId, transferContent, QR
  FE-->>U: Show VietQR and start payment wait
  FE->>Redis: Subscribe payment:status:<paymentId> (long polling route)
  SePay->>Pay: Webhook transaction received
  Pay->>Pay: Reconcile VA/content and mark COMPLETED
  Pay->>Redis: PUBLISH payment:status:<paymentId>
  Pay->>Redis: XADD streams.payment.completed
  Redis-->>Order: payment.completed consumer group
  Order->>Order: Idempotently create order by paymentId
  Order->>Pay: PATCH /payments/:paymentId/link-order
  Order->>Redis: XADD streams.order.created
  Redis-->>Product: order.created consumer group
  Product->>Product: Reserve stock
  alt stock available
    Product->>Redis: XADD streams.stock.reserved
    Redis-->>Order: stock.reserved
    Order->>Order: Confirm order
  else stock unavailable
    Product->>Redis: XADD streams.stock.failed
    Redis-->>Order: stock.failed
    Order->>Order: Cancel order
    Order->>Redis: XADD streams.order.cancelled
  end
  Redis-->>Email: order.created
  Email->>Email: Idempotency SET NX
  Email-->>U: Send order confirmation email

